description "Boba Fett

One of the most fearsome and capable bounty hunters in the galaxy, with some of the deadliest weapons and tech at his disposal.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Frag Grenade (2)

^8Attributes:
- Fuel (3) 
-- Regen: 20/120s
- Beskar (2)
- Blast Armor
- Brawler Guard
- Healing (2)
- Knockdown Roll
- Tracking Beacon
- 10% less knockback taken

^3Abilities:
- Jetpack
- Wrist Flamethrower ^3[CS2]
- Wrist Laser ^3[CS3]"